i=A.a_(["CORE",A.a_(["q","A profitable company has very little cash. What should you investigate first?","o",A.c(["Assume the profit is wrong","Review receivables, inventory, payables and cash-flow movements","Ignore working capital"],r),"a",1,"e","Profit and cash differ because of working-capital movements, non-cash items and timing. Reconcile the movement using evidence."],s,m),"OPS",A.a_(["q","An invoice exceeds its purchase order and receipt quantity. What is the safest action?","o",A.c(["Force it through payment","Split the invoice to bypass the tolerance","Hold and route the mismatch to an accountable owner"],r),"a",2,"e","A mismatch is an exception. Investigate quantity, price, tax and receipt evidence; do not bypass approval controls."],s,m),"DATA",A.a_(["q","Before publishing an AP ageing dashboard, what should you do?","o",A.c(["Reconcile row counts and monetary totals to source data","Hide missing dates","Remove every repeated supplier name"],r),"a",0,"e","Data-quality checks and source reconciliation help establish completeness and accuracy before interpreting the dashboard."],s,m),"AI",A.a_(["q","An invoice-reading model has low confidence on the amount. What should happen?","o",A.c(["Automatically approve payment","Route the item to an authorised human reviewer","Delete the audit trail"],r),"a",1,"e","Low-confidence or high-risk cases need human review, logged decisions and controlled exception handling."],s,m),"TECH",A.a_(["q","A payment API says accepted, but no bank settlement is visible. What is the next step?","o",A.c(["Assume settlement is complete","Post a balancing journal without evidence","Trace transaction IDs and reconcile processor and bank records"],r),"a",2,"e","Accepted, processed and settled are different states. Use identifiers, timestamps and independent records to investigate."],s,m),"CHANGE",A.a_(["q","What makes an Agile user story ready to test?","o",A.c(["Clear acceptance criteria and an observable outcome","A vague request to automate everything","A deadline with no definition of done"],r),"a",0,"e","Acceptance criteria define observable behaviour and help the team test value, controls and completion."],s,m)],s,n).h(0,b5)
